  "description": "EARLY - not ready for real work yet.\n\n      GeoJSON for VL.NetTopologySuite. Read GeoJSON turns GeoJSON text into a spread of\n      NetTopologySuite features; Write GeoJSON turns features back into text. GeoJSONReader\n      (Reactive) reads a file on another thread, with progress and cancellation, so a big file\n      does not freeze vvvv. All three sit in NetTopologySuite.IO, beside Read WKT and Write WKT.\n\n      The features are NetTopologySuite's own Feature type, not a wrapper. VL.NetTopologySuite\n      (installed with this package) opens them with Split and GetAttribute and operates on their\n      geometry; VL.Mapsui draws them on a map. No adapter anywhere in that chain.\n\n      Reads RFC 7946 GeoJSON. Decoded geometry gets SRID 4326, which the format mandates; a\n      Factory pin overrides it. Nothing here reprojects anything.\n\n      Requires vvvv gamma 7.2 or newer (.NET 8).",
