  "releaseNotes": "0.0.1-alpha - First release. Read GeoJSON, GeoJSONReader (Reactive) - a file read and\n      parsed in the background - and Write GeoJSON, in NetTopologySuite.IO.\n      Developed as VL.GeoJSON until 2026-10-18. Requires VL.NetTopologySuite 0.0.4-alpha, which\n      opens the features (Split, GetAttribute) and is installed with this package.",
